{"seq":1,"slug":"risk-measures","title":"风险度量","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"var-cvar","title":"VaR 与 CVaR 风险度量","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/var-cvar","wordCount":1817,"readingTime":8},{"seq":2,"slug":"volatility-models","title":"波动率模型与 GARCH 族","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/volatility-models","wordCount":1966,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"tail-risk","title":"尾部风险与极值理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/quantitative-finance/risk-management-quant/risk-measures/tail-risk","wordCount":2155,"readingTime":9}],"introMarkdown":"# 风险度量\n\n风险度量是量化风险管理的基石，为投资组合的风险暴露提供数值化表达。本章从最广泛使用的 VaR 与 CVaR 度量出发，深入探讨波动率建模的 GARCH 族方法，最后聚焦于尾部风险与极值理论——这些工具共同构成了现代风险度量的核心技术栈。理解这些度量的数学基础、假设条件和适用边界，是进行有效风险管理的前提。\n"}